<title>POLAND: KROSNO MAY NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>KROSNO MAY NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.83 vs   1.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.28 vs   1.93</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.51 vs   2.03</p>
<p> Sales		   15.44 vs  16.42</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.69 vs   5.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.88 vs   8.25</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.97 vs   9.09</p>
<p> Sales		   77.04 vs  76.88</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish glass maker is Krosienskie Huty</p>
<p>Szkla Krosno SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
